		"stall": ["Fresh off the trees this morning.", "Apples, nuts, honey, venison. Autumn's best, while it lasts.",
			"Carved spoons, carved bowls. Carved by me, on long nights.", "Honey from the hollow oak. The bees were cross about it.",
			"Walnuts, a copper a bag. Shells free of charge.", "Smoked venison. Tough as a boot, tastes like autumn.",
