		"market": ["Mushrooms, cider, smoked trout. What'll it be?", "Prices go up when the river floods. Lucky you came now.", "Haggle all you like. I've all day. You've a ship to catch.",
			"Timber ship's in, so the whole town's out spending.", "Wool from the hill farms. Warm as a hearth.",
