		"field": ["Pumpkins came in huge this year. One's bigger than the dog.", "Laundry won't dry in this mist. Third day hanging.",
			"Turnips, beets, onions. Not glamorous. Keeps you alive.", "Deer ate half the cabbages. Lovely creatures. Thieves, all.",
			"Hang the sheets high, or the goats chew them.", "Pull the weeds before frost, or they win next spring.",
