		"well": ["Water's cold as the river's heart. Sweetest on the island.", "Bucket rope's fraying. Somebody should mend it. Not me.",
			"Leaves in the well again. Lid, people. Use the lid.", "Drop a copper and wish. The well's richer than me.",
