		"bench": ["Sit, sit. My legs are done for the day.", "Did you hear? The miller's daughter and the raftsman. Scandal.",
			"Watch the town go by. Best show on the island.", "This bench and I have grown old together. It creaks less.",
			"The mushroom stall's raised its prices again. Shameless.", "Pirates, eh? We had one here once. Married a baker.",
