		"pointer": ["If you're after work, {who} {where} has been muttering about something for days.", "{who}'s got trouble. Real trouble, this time, not the usual.",
			"Go and see {who} {where}. Nobody else will help, and it's getting worse.", "{who} {where} looked worried this morning. Worth a word.",
