	"menu": ["What can I do for you, Captain?", "A pirate, at my door? Well, come in out of the mist.",
		"Captain! Mind the sawdust. What brings you over?", "You've the look of someone with questions. Ask away.",
		"Sit a moment. The woods can wait. What is it?", "Ah, the captain from the bay. Need something?",
		"Speak up, the mill's loud today. What's on your mind?", "Not often a pirate stops to chat. I'm listening.",
