	"rumour_menu": ["What's the word on this island?", "Heard anything about the islands ahead?"],
	"rumour_isle": {
		"camp": ["They say {name} stole a whole raft of timber and built a fort out of it. Cheeky. Good joinery, though.",
			"{name}'s lot poach deer in the lord's old wood. There's no lord any more. Something still minds."],
		"beast": ["{name} walks the deep wood. The trees lean away from it, they say, and it doesn't need the paths.",
			"Nobody goes past the old oaks any more. {name} has been seen there, and the woodcutters who went to look have not."],
		"lair": ["Something's nesting in the caves under the hill. The wisps gather at the mouth at night, like moths."],
		"ruins": ["The old stones in the woods were a chapel once. The moss grew over the words, and now nobody remembers whose."],
		"lookout": ["Climb the lookout on a clear day and the whole island's red and gold below you. Prettiest sight in the sea."],
		"any": ["Something's wrong out at {name}. The birds won't sing there.", "My brother went to {name} once. Came back with a basket of mushrooms nobody can name, and a limp."],
