	"rumour_chain": [
		"Ships that reach {name} come back with stories. {blurb}, they say, and stranger than here.",
		"A trader swore {name} has no trees at all. Can you imagine? What do they build with?",
		"The needle pulls toward {name} next. {blurb}. Take warm clothes, or cool ones. I don't know, I've never been.",
		"I've a cousin on {name}. Writes every spring. Never says much. Nobody does, out there.",
	],
	"rumour_quiet": ["Quiet island, this. The woods drink sound. That's how you know they're listening.",
		"Rumours? Only that the cider's strong this year. True, too.",
		"Nothing worth your ears. The woods keep their secrets close.",
		"Can't say I've heard a thing. Ask the owls. They see more.",
		"Quiet season. Pirates and beasts both seem to be sleeping.",
		"Not a whisper. That's either good news or very bad news.",
		"Heard nothing, Captain. The mill drowns out the gossip.",
		"No news here. The last news was a goat in the chapel.",
		"Nothing new. Same mist, same trees, same old faces."],
	"rumour_fork": "The sea splits past here: {a}, or {b}. Toss a coin. The trees say {a}, but trees would.",
	"rumour_end": "Past us? The edge of the world, the old ones say, and the root of the great tree that holds it up.",
	"rumour_hard": "Harder country than this, mind. Their woods have teeth.",
	"self_menu": "Tell me about yourself.",
	"accept": "I'll see to it.",
	"decline": "Not now.",
	"taken": ["Good. I'll be here. Where else would I be?",
		"Truly? Bless you, Captain. Stay off the deer trails.",
		"That's a weight off. I'll put the kettle on for when you're back.",
		"Ha! I knew a pirate would do it. Nobody here would.",
		"Thank you. Watch the mist; it plays tricks.",
		"You're a good sort, for a pirate. Off you go, then.",
		"Grand. I'll tell the others. No, I won't. I'll surprise them.",
		"Done, then. Mind the wolves, and the roots, and the wolves again.",
		"Come back with all your fingers. The last helper didn't.",
		"Right. I'll be waiting, chewing my nails to the knuckle.",
		"Shake on it. There. A pirate's handshake. Firm, that."],
	"notices": {
		"board": ["A notice board under a little shingled roof, pinned thick with bark-paper.",
			"The board by the mill, sticky with sap and crowded with notices.",
			"Nails, twine and notices, curling in the damp. Some are fresh.",
			"An oak plank board, carved with names and covered in warnings.",
			"Bark-paper notices flutter on the board. One has a wolf's paw print on it.",
			"A leaning board by the well, half its notices faded by the mist."],
		"bounty": ["WANTED: {name}. Poaching deer and stealing timber. Report the deed to {poster}.",
			"BOUNTY on {name}, camped in our woods with a gang of cutthroats. A purse waits with {poster}.",
			"{name} burned a woodshed and robbed a raft. Bring word of their end to {poster}.",
