		"posted": ["You did it? Truly? Here's the purse, and the town's thanks with it.",
			"I'll take the notice down myself. Best job I've had all year.",
			"Well! The woodcutters will sing your name tonight. Badly, but loudly.",
			"That's the bravest thing I've seen since the flood. Take your reward.",
			"I posted that half-sure nobody would come. Glad I was wrong.",
			"Done and dusted. Here's your coin. Spend some of it at the inn.",
