	"service": {
		"inn": ["Beds upstairs, stew by the fire, cider by the jug.",
			"Room's warm and the sheets are clean. Mostly clean.",
			"Boots off by the hearth. Sawdust stays outside.",
			"Stay the night. The woods are no place after dark.",
			"Rest up, Captain. The mist will still be there tomorrow.",
