		"trade": ["Timber, rope, resin, salt. Everything a ship eats.",
			"Pirate loot? I'll buy it. No questions, low prices.",
			"Got anything shiny from the old chests? I pay fair.",
			"Venison jerky, hard bread, lamp oil. Stock up before you sail.",
			"Sell me your bits and bobs. I'll sell them to the mainland.",
			"Furs, antlers, oddments. If it's from the woods, I want it."],
